{
  "name": "@dsh-plugins/dockyard",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "本机开发服务的可观测托管台：扫描项目、受监管地启停应用、tail 日志，并在 DSH 侧栏提供状态面板。",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "src",
    "locale",
    "icon.svg",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@dsh-plugins/plugin-kit": "workspace:*"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "$comment": "依赖 @dsh-plugins/plugin-kit（工作区内）。@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools 与 @deepseek-ai/schemastery 由宿主提供，刻意不声明为依赖：它们不在公开 npm 上，声明会让 pnpm install 失败。插件在宿主进程内加载，运行时通过 Node 解析取得它们。"
}
